{"title":"Career Roadmap · Content Marketing Executive","role":"Content Marketing Executive","summary":"A Content Marketing Executive plans, creates, distributes, and measures content that attracts a target audience and supports brand awareness, engagement, lead generation, customer acquisition, and retention. With an Event/Media/Film Business background, the role benefits from strong storytelling, video production, audience understanding, campaign planning, and media-business knowledge.","facts":{"Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Event / Media / Film Business"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus","What changes"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Media & marketing foundations"},{"text":"Marketing, storytelling, media, consumer behaviour"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Content execution"},{"text":"Writing, social media, video, SEO"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Content strategy"},{"text":"Campaigns, analytics, content calendars"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Content management"},{"text":"Strategy, teams, budgets, brand voice"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Content leadership"},{"text":"Brand ecosystem and multi-channel strategy"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-native content"},{"text":"AI-assisted production, personalisation, immersive media"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business + media foundations"},{"text":"Marketing, communication, media literacy"},{"text":"Brand/content analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Content creation"},{"text":"Writing, design, video, social media"},{"text":"Content portfolio"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"SEO, analytics, campaigns, CRM"},{"text":"Content ma